  <content>
    <section class="practice" id="sect-00001"><title>Warm Up</title>
      
        <media alt="A PICTURE OF A CARNIVAL">
          <image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/Algebra-1_01_12_02_01.jpg"/>
        </media>
      
      <para id="para-00001">Jada has $20 to spend on games and rides at a carnival. Games cost $1 each and rides are $2 each.</para>
      <para id="para-00002">In the following activity, you will complete a series of questions regarding this scenario.</para>
      <note class="link-to-learning" id="note-00001">
        <para id="para-00003">Log into <link url="https://student.desmos.com">student.desmos.com</link> using the information provided by your teacher to complete the activity.</para>
      </note>
    </section>
  </content>
